  "description": "<p data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"146\"><strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"146\">Donker, sfeervol puzzel-avontuur vol spanning, stijl en unieke horror – In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"495\"><em data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"167\">Little Nightmares</em> is een beklemmende en prachtig vormgegeven game waarin je speelt als <strong data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"244\">Six</strong>, een klein meisje dat probeert te ontsnappen uit <em data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"303\">The Maw</em> — een duister, surrealistisch complex vol bizarre en gevaarlijke bewoners. De game combineert puzzels, stealth en platforming met een onvergetelijke sfeer die zowel spannend als artistiek is.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"724\">De visuele stijl, het sound design en de constante spanning maken <em data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"582\">Little Nightmares</em> tot een bijzondere indie-topper die blijft nazinderen. Dit exemplaar is een <strong data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"678\">losse cartridge</strong> (geen doosje) en verkeert <strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"723\">In Nette Staat</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"766\"><strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"766\">Waarom Little Nightmares zo uniek is</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"1011\">\r\n<li data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"826\">\r\n<p data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"826\">👁️ Sfeervolle en beklemmende horror zonder jumpscares</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"869\">\r\n<p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"869\">🧩 Slimme puzzels en stealth-elementen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"909\">\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"909\">🎨 Prachtige en herkenbare artstyle</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<p data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"949\">🏃 Intens, verhaalgedreven avontuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"990\">\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"990\">🧱 <strong data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"974\">Losse cartridge</strong> (geen doosje)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1011\">\r\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1011\">✨ In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1016\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1042\">📋 <strong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1042\">Specificaties</strong></h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1263\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1068\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1068\">\r\n<th data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1057\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eigenschap</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1068\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1263\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1137\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1106\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soort game</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1137\">Horror / puzzel / adventure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Platform</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1168\">Nintendo Switch</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1198\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1182\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Speelmodus</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1198\">Singleplayer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1236\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Meegeleverd</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1236\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1234\">Losse cartridge</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1263\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1245\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Staat</td>\r\n<td